    "bbox": [
      150.48,
      412.39,
      281.68,
      422.48
    ],
    "text": "Land Min's Ref .No.: 4-3/15/2017.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-ItalicMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.078991889953613
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      55.68,
      437.84,
      281.75,
      495.92
    ],
    "text": "I , hereby notify, under Sub-section 7 of the LandAcquisition Act, as amended by the Land Acquisition(Amendments) Act, No. 28 of 1964, that the governmentintends to acquire the following land/servitude which isrequired for public purpose.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.078991889953613
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      64.8,
      509.83,
      274.0,
      519.91
    ],
    "text": "Description of the land or servitude to be acquired:",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-ItalicMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.078991889953613
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      55.68,
      533.84,
      281.91,
      639.92
    ],
    "text": "An allotment of the land called Bogathugahahena orBokutugahahena situated at the Village of Morawaka inthe Grama Niladhari's Division of Morawaka (257) in theDivisional Secretariat of Kotapola in the District of Matarain the Southern Province, bearing lot No. 699 of sheetNo. 30 of Supplementary sheet No. 26 in the Final VillagePlan No. 4-40 prepared by the Survey General Containingin extent about 0.2017 Hectares and boundaries of the landas follows.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.078991889953613
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      55.68,
      653.88,
      281.51,
      690.08
    ],
    "text": "Lot No. 699Land Called Bogathugahahena or Bokutugahahenacontaining in extent about 0.2017 Hectares.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-BoldMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.078991889953613
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      307.2,
      347.6,
      547.3,
      369.68
    ],
    "text": "Owner of the Land : Ridiyagamage Nandawathie residednearby Fairy Mount Tea Factory of Morawaka.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.078991889953613
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      316.32,
      383.6,
      495.68,
      429.68
    ],
    "text": "On the North by:- Lot Nos. 698, 82F3 and 700On the East by:- Lot Nos. 700 and 82EOn the South by:- Lot Nos. 82E and 698On the West by:- Lot Nos. 698 and 82F3",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.078991889953613
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      307.2,
      443.6,
      547.41,
      489.68
    ],
    "text": "All persons interested in the aforesaid land/servitude is tobe acquired are hereby to appear personally, or by agentsduly authorized in writing, before me at the DivisionalSecretariat, Kotapola on 08.08.2018 at 10.00 o' clock.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.078991889953613
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      307.2,
      503.6,
      547.19,
      573.68
    ],
    "text": "Further, I hereby requested to notify to me in writing (induplicate) on or before the 01.08.2018 the nature of theirinterests in the land, the particulars of their claims forcompensation of the said land/servitude, the amount ofcompensation and the details of compensation of suchamount.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.078991889953613
    ]
  },
